Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.43,0:00:05.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:09.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She doesn't stay late enough \Nto eat dinner in the office often...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:12.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,March on, Meowtaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:16.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, meow! Meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.32,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's singing her heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:17.58,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She noticed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:22.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,March on, Meowtaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.05,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She kept singing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:27.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}And she wants me to join in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:32.51,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Good job, Shinozaki-san! \NThat was nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:36.06,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a cute abuse of authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:44.12,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:53.74,Show_Title,Title sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H292A2F&\bord0}My {\1a&HFF&\bord1\3c&HA183CA&}T{\3c&H000000&}iny {\bord0\1a&H00&}Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:56.82,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We've got an emergency here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.60,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Are you paying attention, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:05.83,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}There's someone other than me \Ndancing around inside of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.83,0:01:08.08,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I want to talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.13,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I want to touch her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:16.62,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.13,0:01:19.84,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}What in the world am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:22.60,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You're right next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:28.85,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And this is the perfect chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:30.43,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.43,0:01:35.14,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.14,0:01:38.35,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And I don't think I can ever escape
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:40.85,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I may as well just sink into it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:41.68,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:46.45,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It's another day in your dazzling presence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.46,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We may never be \Non the same page with this love but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:55.89,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:13.48,Episode_Title,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,525)\pos(40,315)\an1\fsp4}#11 {\fsp1}Can I Give You a Big {\c&H876FD1&}H{\c}ug?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:13.09,Main - Top,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,{\an8}What should I drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:17.99,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Working late on your entry? Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:20.48,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Here, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:22.12,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Thank... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:25.62,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Why not just throw together something simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.97,0:02:29.70,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Well, I'm headed home. See you around!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:34.26,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Can't just... throw something together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.53,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Need to help the director aim higher...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:40.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.89,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What's wrong, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:47.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I should be the one asking you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:51.15,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}The deadline for the competition \Nis soon. He might be overdoing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:54.25,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:56.17,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is what I say but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:59.86,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm freaking out on the inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:03.62,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pressure of competing directly \Nwith someone at work for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:06.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}the responsibility of needing \Nto keep our manager with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:13.13,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's so much I could use some rehab, \Nbut I can't tell Senpai that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.45,0:03:16.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,See...? I'm fine... \NNow, let's get to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:21.93,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:26.66,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Specially made by your senpai, \Nit's the kanji for "person."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.52,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Please, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:32.36,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:35.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You're worried about your proposal for \Nthe competition being perfect, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:41.07,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Please don't be afraid to fail. \NIt doesn't matter if it goes smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:44.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'd even say this contest is about \Naccepting that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:47.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Just swing as hard as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.34,0:03:49.45,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And it's just accepted I'll miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:51.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:51.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:54.21,Sign_Basic,Office Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(454,142)\an9\c&H455051&\bord0\shad0\b1}Product Development
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:54.21,Sign_Basic,Office Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(454,212)\an9\c&H2C3437&\bord0\shad0\b1\fs20}Group 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:54.21,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:58.48,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,The concept, the targeting... \NBoth are clearly laid out and easy to grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:03:59.97,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:03.73,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,All you need now is an image to \Nillustrate the complete project
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:03.22,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H1A1C1C&\pos(156.667,108)\an8\frz13.25\bord0\shad0\b1}The Ultimate Meowtaro
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:06.18,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,and it'll be an even easier sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.74,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,An illustration...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:10.72,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Yeah. Even a simple one would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:16.11,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,You're almost there. \NDon't worry, Kurusu. You can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:19.51,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:26.78,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai helped me calm down some.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:29.29,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:31.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.76,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:51.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You know that girl, Kurusu, \Nin Development Group 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:53.52,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sure, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:56.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She's taking on the new hire contest like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:05:00.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,and I think she's feeling \Njust as much pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:06.16,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,If you see her, I'd appreciate it if you \Ncould try and help her feel better...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:11.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sorry, I know I shouldn't be \Nasking you to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:14.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But I think she'd be too on-guard around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:18.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Not to mention, I may be being \Nnosy for no good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:21.25,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:23.93,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:25.26,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:34.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Still working?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:40.52,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,You're from Development Group 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:42.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm Katase Shiori.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Do you always stay this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:47.85,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,That's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:51.91,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,There are some things a third party \Nmight have a clearer view on, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:54.41,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Group 2 is the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:56.29,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I have nothing to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.25,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I sit with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:05:59.43,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.04,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That pouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:05.80,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It was released for Meowtaro's \N20th anniversary, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:07.93,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,You recognize it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:10.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I have one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:13.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,There was another one \Nthat came out with a ribbon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.14,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I have that one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:20.37,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Meowtaro's head was rounder \Nback then, with smaller eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.37,0:06:23.54,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,and you could tell the art was more \Nanalog, but that made it cuter...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:26.94,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,A-And well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:32.45,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Even though this is the Meowtaro company... \NI don't get many chances to talk about him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:37.21,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,If you like Meowtaro that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:45.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,you must be really motivated \Nfor the rookie competition, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:51.35,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Katase-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:57.72,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Katase-san, is there anything \Nyou have trouble with at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.19,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,A whole lot of things!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:06.32,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Laying out diagrams and adjusting text...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:13.31,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Could you look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:18.88,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Does it remind you of any Taro in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:21.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's a very leading question!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:24.84,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I'm no good at art...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:27.53,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I've managed to keep that \Na secret the past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.29,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,But I can't anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.72,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I don't want to disappoint her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:39.46,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I've tried so many times...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:41.23,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,but I just can't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:47.11,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I want to do a good job, Katase-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:50.11,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,How can I deliver for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:52.61,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.23,0:07:55.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Maybe you should just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:58.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,tell her that you can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.92,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,But if I do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:05.10,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Admitting when you can't do \Nsomething is part of your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:09.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:15.27,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,No one's going to ridicule you\Nfor having tried your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:22.22,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Okay... I'll try and tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:25.99,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.49,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I've... updated my proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.90,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Please, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:37.81,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Sure. Knowing you, Kurusu, \NI'm sure it's evolved a fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:44.16,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H1A1C1C&\pos(156.667,108)\an8\frz13.25\bord0\shad0\b1}The Ultimate Meowtaro
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.74,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,This art...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:43.75,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I'm... so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:49.66,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I tried, but... it was... \Nthe best I could do...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.59,0:08:57.18,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,You said I would be able \Nto do it... but I failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:02.93,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,No, you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:05.19,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,You didn't fail, Kurusu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.37,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,I should be the one to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.97,0:09:11.44,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,I thought I was encouraging you, \Nbut I was just pouring on more pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:13.77,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me, Kurusu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:15.69,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Director...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:21.05,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Hanaoka-san, could you help \Nwith Kurusu's proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.05,0:09:22.20,Main,Hanaoka,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:23.65,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Sorry about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.21,Main,Hanaoka,0,0,0,,It's no problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:28.36,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,There's a couple of days left \Nbefore the deadline!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:31.46,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,We're going to support Kurusu \Nas much as we can in that time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.46,Main,Dev Group 1,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:37.10,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Development Group 1 is really motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:37.72,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:43.05,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a relief...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:50.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,He's under a lot of pressure himself, but he's \Nstill nice enough to worry about others...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.13,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Did I do something funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:10:01.55,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Not at all. I'm just impressed \Nwith you, Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:05.11,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wh-What for, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.37,Main,Shiori+Kurusu,0,0,0,,March on, Meowtaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:12.00,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:16.29,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Tiny Meowtaro{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.29,0:10:17.58,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,You sure that's the title?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:20.89,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's finally the day of the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:23.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Everything ready, Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:25.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yep! All set.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.07,0:10:28.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You're absolutely sure you're ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.40,Main,Shinozakui,0,0,0,,I am really sure that I'm all set!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.39,0:10:33.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:36.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to make \Na Meowtaro costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.22,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you a goddess, Hayakawa-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:40.93,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Not really, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:45.07,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Compared to my usual, cosplay it was \Npretty simple, so it's not like...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:45.07,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your usual what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:48.70,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Uh, er, nothing! Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.04,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:54.22,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thank you for all your help, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:11:00.35,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, is it just me, or are you \Nmore nervous than I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:03.94,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,My direct subordinate is entering his \Nbiggest moment of the entire year!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:06.43,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.43,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I am so full of butterflies right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:12.88,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, calm down. It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:12.88,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is there anything else I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.10,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Kurusu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:22.32,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,During the presentations... I go on before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:26.20,Main,SFX Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(116,195)\c&HA0A5B0&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs14\bord1.5\4c&H907C86&}Hrmmm
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:26.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It kind of ended up feeling like \Na showdown, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:28.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Let's both do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.97,0:11:29.81,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.17,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:38.80,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Katase-san mentioned... \Nyou were worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:44.93,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I'm... grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:47.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.21,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:54.81,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,We're going to win. \NWin, and take your manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:58.02,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I don't intend on losing, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.57,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We're going to win, and keep our manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:07.02,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Looking forward to your presentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:11.30,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:15.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,This talk about losing \Nor keeping the manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:18.12,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:22.42,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, well... the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:24.55,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,The truth is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:28.93,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:34.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Report! Stay in contact! Consult!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.93,0:12:38.19,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(316,72)\an8\fs16\b1\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&}Report
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:38.19,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(316,132)\an8\fs16\b1\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&}Stay in contact
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:38.19,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(316,192)\an8\fs16\b1\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&}Consult
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:36.88,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You didn't do any one of those!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.19,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:40.30,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,I knew about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:41.12,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,So I'm the only one who didn't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:46.58,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Maybe we can still negotiate...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:50.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But she's probably already into her proposal...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:52.25,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:53.75,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:58.13,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Specially made by your kouhai, \Nit's the kanji for "person."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:03.26,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I really am sorry that \NI didn't tell you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:08.26,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But I've been under your guidance \Nfor a whole year now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.77,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I know I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:21.58,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Gosh... if you put it like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.02,0:13:25.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I won't be able to say anything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:32.04,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san is guaranteed to win \Nthe most valuable rookie award!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:32.78,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:35.79,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You just need spirit! Let's all huddle up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:36.90,Main,Shinozaki/Manager,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:36.90,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:39.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Development Group 2, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.27,Main,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.92,Sign_Basic,Screen sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs14\c&HC6CAC7&\bord0\shad0\move(280,-17,280,19)}Group 1
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.92,Sign_Basic,Screen sign,0,0,0,,{\move(328,30,328,66)\an8\fs18\c&HCDB3A7&\bord0\shad0}Team Kurusu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:46.18,Main,MC,0,0,0,,That was the presentation from \NKurusu's team with Development Group 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:57.94,Main,MC,0,0,0,,Next will be Shinozaki's team \Nfrom Development Group 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.19,0:14:04.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know I said he was guaranteed \Nto win most valuable rookie...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:05.94,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I'm still worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:12.45,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Our proposal involves coming up \Nwith new ways to share "fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:17.11,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,"Taking what I enjoy today, and letting \Nother people enjoy it tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:19.83,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,And in order to make that possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:23.80,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H5C605D&\bord0\shad0\fs18\b1\fay-.27\frx4\fry352\pos(156.667,55.334)}Group 2
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:23.80,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF8569&\bord0\shad0\fs18\b1\fay-.25\frx4\fry352\pos(218.667,122.667)}Team Shinozaki
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:23.80,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,we will need Meowtaro, the super friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.18,0:14:25.73,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Super friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:28.30,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.85,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:36.18,Sign_Basic,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\move(282,53,260,53)\c&H2E2F31&\fs12\3c&HFCFCFA&\shad0}Strategy meeting\NFriends
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:32.75,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:36.18,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's something that came to mind \Nwhen we were with the preschool class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.09,0:14:39.64,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There're unlimited ways to have fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:43.57,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What if there was someone who existed \Nto help people share that fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:45.82,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What if they had that kind of friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:47.15,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:52.07,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I was hoping to ask you all about \Nwhat you heard about from the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:55.24,Flashback,Manager,0,0,0,,There was one who liked skateboarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:57.54,Flashback,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I remember one who was good with magic tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:14:58.77,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:03.50,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,This friend could recommend \Nthose kinds of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:06.46,Flashback,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,and it'll create fondness and \Nidentification almost instantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:07.60,Main,Male Employee 1,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:09.40,Main,Male Employee 2,0,0,0,,Look at him go on that skateboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:10.97,Main,Male EMployees (General),0,0,0,,I wanna try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.69,Main,Male EMployees (General),0,0,0,,Looks like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:15.72,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Things are working out \Njust like Shinozaki-san planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:18.57,Main,Female Employee 1,0,0,0,,Is that Shinozaki-kun inside the suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.57,0:15:20.48,Main,Female Employee 2,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I think I might fall for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:26.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's working out as planned, \Nbut maybe he's overdoing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:32.24,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, Meowtaro is Meowtaro. There's not \Nsupposed to be anyone "in the suit."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:38.77,Main,Female employees (general),0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:39.76,Main,Female employees (general),0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:41.25,Main,Female employees (general),0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:42.82,Main - Top,Female employees (general),0,0,0,,{\an8}You're amazing, Meowtaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:46.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aren't they all getting a little \Ntouchy with that costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:44.03,Main - Top,Female employees (general),0,0,0,,{\an8}So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:50.80,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're grown adults. You should realize \Nthere's someone inside that suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:52.51,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,0)\pos(128,255)\fs18\b1\fnComic Sans MS\c&H000000&\3c&HFCFEFE&\shad0}Completely ignoring what she\Nwas thinking minutes ago
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.71,0:15:54.89,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:16:00.51,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was a wonderful finish \Nfor your first year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:05.02,Main,MC,0,0,0,,That was Team Shinozaki from Development Group 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:09.78,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:12.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Your presentation was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:15.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll win \Nthe most valuable rookie award!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:20.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It looks like Hayakawa-san \Nwent back to her seat already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:26.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,And, well... I know you might be \Nfeeling tired right now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:29.67,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I was hoping I could ask for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:35.39,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Can I give you a big hug, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:41.43,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-It's just that everyone else was doing it, \Nand I was wondering what it was like!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:48.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Why are you running?! \NYou let everyone else touch you lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:49.77,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:52.28,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sorry I had to duck out like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:55.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There was an urgent data correction \NI had to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:56.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:58.78,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Then, who's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.39,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,This Meowtaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:07.67,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:09.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:12.77,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Go and give her a big hug!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:14.67,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:18.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come on, they're announcing the winner! \NLet's get back to the hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:21.20,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,No hug, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:23.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Stop, Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:29.81,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HB0B3B0&\bord0\shad0\fs16\b1\move(325,15,325,49)\an8}Results Announcement
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:29.81,Main,MC,0,0,0,,The time has come. I will now be announcing \Nthe results of the new hire competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:32.63,Main,Male Employees(General),0,0,0,,Who the heck is gonna win?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:36.18,Main,Female Employees (General),0,0,0,,That Meowtaro was Akina-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:35.29,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:40.19,Main,MC,0,0,0,,Now, before the prizes are presented, \Na few words from the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:44.33,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HB0B3B0&\bord0\shad0\fs16\b1\pos(325,48)\an8}Most Valuable New Hire Award
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:44.67,Main,President,0,0,0,,Before we announce \Nthe most valuable rookie award,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:47.83,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HB0B3B0&\bord0\shad0\fs16\b1\an8\pos(324,42)}Excellence Award Team 1
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:47.83,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HB0B3B0&\bord0\shad0\fs16\b1\an8\pos(324,84)}Excellence Award Team 2
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:47.83,Main,President,0,0,0,,I'd like to award the two teams \Nreceiving the awards for excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:50.34,Main,President,0,0,0,,The first will be going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:53.49,Main,President,0,0,0,,Shinozaki's team with Development Group 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.59,Main,President,0,0,0,,The other...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:17:58.84,Main,President,0,0,0,,Kurusu's team with Development Group 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:02.85,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H5B5D5F&\bord0\shad0\fs16\b1\an8\fnArial\b1\pos(320,24)}Most Valuable New Hire Award
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:02.85,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnArial\b1\c&H585A5C&\bord0\shad0\pos(124,150)}Excellence Award\NDevelopment Group 2\NTeam Shinozaki
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:02.85,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnArial\b1\c&H585A5C&\bord0\shad0\pos(516,150)}Excellence Award\NDevelopment Group 1\NTeam Kurusu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:02.85,Main,President,0,0,0,,These are our excellence \Naward winners! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:06.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I guess I ended up tying with Kurusu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:08.75,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The Okinawan resort...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:12.02,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:14.12,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You might not have won \Nthe most promising rookie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:16.24,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,but the excellence award is great, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You should be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:21.51,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.57,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,An award of excellence, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:29.12,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:31.58,Main,Takatsuka,0,0,0,,Whatever for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:37.99,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Everyone helped me... but I \Ncouldn't win most valuable new hire...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:42.64,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,No one's upset with you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:47.28,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your award, Kurusu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:51.60,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,But you won't get their manager now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:54.89,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,You said you needed him for your ambitions...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:59.62,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,I was so focused on \Nthe competition I forgot about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:02.28,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,You forgot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:02.95,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:04.95,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.95,0:19:08.45,Sign_Basic,Banner sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H313041&\fs16\3c&HF3F6F3&\shad0\b1\frz2.897\move(406,186,322,186)}You're a-meow-zing,\NDev Group 1 Team Kurusu
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:08.45,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Seeing everyone work so hard \Nmade me realize something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:12.21,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,All I need to strive for greater heights...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.09,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,are my valuable subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:18.34,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Director...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:21.84,Main,Takatsukasa,0,0,0,,Here's to further working together, Kurusu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:23.33,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:29.75,Main,President,0,0,0,,And now, at long last, we will be announcing \Nthe most valuable rookie award!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:31.98,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H5B5D5F&\bord0\shad0\fs16\b1\an8\fnArial\b1\pos(320,24)}Most Valuable New Hire Award
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:31.98,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnArial\b1\c&H585A5C&\bord0\shad0\pos(124,150)}Excellence Award\NDevelopment Group 2\NTeam Shinozaki
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:31.98,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnArial\b1\c&H585A5C&\bord0\shad0\pos(516,150)}Excellence Award\NDevelopment Group 1\NTeam Kurusu
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:35.48,Main,President,0,0,0,,Out of all the submissions, the one selected \Nfor the most prestigious prize is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.89,0:19:38.48,Main,President,0,0,0,,Yamagishi's team from Public Relations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:42.19,Main,Yamagishi (M),0,0,0,,No way... Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:44.12,Main,Ishiyama,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:46.44,Main,MC,0,0,0,,Where did you get the idea \Nfor your proposal from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:48.22,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Nowhere in particular...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:51.09,Main,Ishiyama,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to my daily guidance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:54.04,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,He was the least motivated, and yet...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:57.00,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,This is... really frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:20:01.93,Main,MC,0,0,0,,And that concludes the annual \Nnew hire competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:06.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san, you did a great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.65,Main,Manager,0,0,0,,There's a big wrap party to celebrate, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:10.93,Main,Ishiyama,0,0,0,,It'll be my victory party!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:11.92,Main,Yamagishi; shinozaki; Kurusu,0,0,0,,No, it won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:13.02,Main,Ishiyama,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:30.23,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:35.13,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I still can't bring myself \Nto drink that bitter coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:39.61,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}So I sneakily toss in \Ntwo pinches of a sweet secret
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:43.83,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And let it slowly spread throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:48.79,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}There's a local bakery \Nthat's only open sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.79,0:20:53.68,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Where I once had some toast that glittered
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:58.18,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}What is it that makes it so satisfying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:02.35,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Almost like magic
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:07.43,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I find myself thinking about that kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.43,0:21:13.04,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}How the small things can be the most precious
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:17.83,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Deep inside my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:22.23,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It's ever so bittersweet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:27.15,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}"Just being around you is enough"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:31.17,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Becomes my mantra
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:33.46,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Baby like sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:42.72,Main,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Baby you're the sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.31,0:21:48.29,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Work drags so much in the afternoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:49.56,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:51.45,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Just the excellence one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:55.01,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,It ain't like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:00.21,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Holler at you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.09,0:22:04.34,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Forget... what you heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:06.09,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Not gonna happen that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.09,0:22:08.72,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Don't try the physical approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:11.93,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,What's the big deal anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:14.49,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,It's... embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.49,0:22:16.73,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,I don't see how.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:22.75,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,We don't have any sort of obvious accent \Nwhere I'm from, so I'm kinda jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.27,0:22:25.99,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Jealous...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.99,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Yeah, it's kinda cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:33.12,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Man, lunch is gonna end \Nif we don't wrap up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:34.74,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.61,0:22:39.25,Main,Kurusu,0,0,0,,Thank you kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.29,0:22:43.77,Main,Yamagishi(M),0,0,0,,Thank me whatly?
